-- Bare Whiterun is a registry mask; the sidecar shadows only ^Whiterun. The same fold descriptors consume both selections, and the empty identityless maximum contributes no row.
--! registry ../registries/028-reductions.reg

--! out 3
#/ (Merchant & !Whiterun)

--! out 2
#/ (Merchant & !^Whiterun)

--! out 80
+/ Gold @ (Merchant & !Whiterun)

--! out 150
+/ Gold @ (Merchant & !^Whiterun)

--! out 0
+/ Gold @ None

--! out
max/ Gold @ None
